// How many kept pairs have a positive labeled margin.
// No pair returns nothing. A zero margin does not count.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE mcount ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG mcount rank

IMPULSE mcount 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "mcount" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
